# Local dev-only Postgres data directory (mirrors the app-data folder used in
# production, kept out of git the same way).
.pgdata/

# AGENTS.md is Next's own auto-generated agent file (disabled via
# agentRules: false in next.config.mjs, but ignored as a safety net in case
# that ever lapses). CLAUDE.md is NOT ignored - we maintain our own, see it
# and PROGRESS.md for the real project record.
AGENTS.md

# Issued licences. tools/issue-licence.js writes these into the current folder,
# which is usually the project root - and each one is a signed token naming a
# real customer and a real machine. They belong in WhatsApp and in
# ~/.pump-manager/register.csv, never in a repo that gets pushed.
*-licence-seat*.txt
